OL,5,G0630 Breakfast
OL,6,     FHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,7,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,8,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,9,G0900 Saturday Morning
OL,10,     FTom talks to legendary violinist,
OL,11,     FChristian Tetzlaff about his
OL,12,     Fcareer as a violinist and his
OL,13,     Fmission, not to entertain, but to
OL,14,     Freveal the beauty and innate depth
OL,15,     Fof music.
OL,16,G1200 Earlier... with Jools Holland
OL,17,     FJools is joined by the jazz singer
OL,18,     Fand lyricist Norma Winstone.
